G1 Z1 F1000 ; lift head
G90 ; absolute positioning

G1 X0 Y0 F3000 ; move to home

G91 ; relative positioning
G1 Z-1 F1000 ; lower head back down
G90 ; absolute positioning

M300 S1000 P2000 ; beep
M0 ; wait for user — press knob to resume

